### Get properties default
GET http://localhost:5164/api/properties
Accept: application/json

### Get properties page 1 sized 6
GET http://localhost:5164/api/properties?page=1&pageSize=6
Accept: application/json

### Get properties page 2 sized 6
GET http://localhost:5164/api/properties?page=2&pageSize=6
Accept: application/json

### Get properties invalid page size
GET http://localhost:5164/api/properties?page=1&pageSize=6
Accept: application/json
